        <mxCell id="poolnote" parent="cognito" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#545B64;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=0;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;User pool:&lt;/b&gt; email as username, auto-verified by code, wizard name in &lt;code&gt;preferred_username&lt;/code&gt; (unique, DD-018), password policy 8+ with upper/lower/number/symbol, default email sender (about 50 emails/day).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;App client:&lt;/b&gt; public, no secret, &lt;code&gt;USER_PASSWORD_AUTH&lt;/code&gt; + refresh tokens, no Hosted UI. Its Lambdas are below: the Pre Sign-up trigger and the guest name check." vertex="1">
